{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/461bbu9u3jh22iht2fthisu0vfnthi4.mp3","text":"我们应该一起去外面逛逛，在这里坐着干啥？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/7ln6xdgw8ot5uwfplmhvl74fo25kler.mp3","text":"下周的足球赛我可是首发，你一定要来看啊。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/fc0ug2kcseoiwlkinytq2ehgl620waj.mp3","text":"要是你们那儿有改进闪光护盾的好办法，尽管提测试申请，我随时就位。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/7kfsou4fshpu7qr7m8k3x2anudsbhtg.mp3","text":"放轻松，你太紧张了，需不需要我请战车来给你跳个芭蕾？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/ntakw1sqg6uzdk98663n8f1nu4wmw4d.mp3","text":"医生们测试我不是因为病症，而是因为我足够强壮。还好我并不害怕针头。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/rhwbjbjfv7ecf5hg8edp44v1vekvikj.mp3","text":"闪一下，捶一下，砰！搞定！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/smnmfrhsiov7ddxsug7s4srhywmksu7.mp3","text":"是，我就是很欢乐，而且很幽默。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/p2ksnhpyc3eglbxyrufv78a86xc4b68.mp3","text":"要是有好事，记得带我一起玩。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/ienytzr55n7uml902mgr0ff9n2xqwmd.mp3","text":"我们大家有责任照顾好彼此，这件事情我绝对不开玩笑。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/huqx6p4h4yjkfmq56ze6hqbtfshd0fy.mp3","text":"这个挺有趣，但对我来说还缺点意思。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/q8q4mt3ap0smhn2adarctdad8hbo4kn.mp3","text":"彩虹小队成员，代号闪击。你下令，我就把盾拍在目标脸上！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/lnj40p8l6o3cebait6ndgrcpg0rcpe3.mp3","text":"这个还挺不错，哦我是说爆米花，要来点吗？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/cmphl9fw9adqd512wpikrr0yqkwdplg.mp3","text":"褒奖啊勋章之类的东西，你不觉得这些很适合挂在盾上吗？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/8pnkj1j0xwo7hgeoqf2f25oqnw4my50.mp3","text":"我不喜欢拍自己的照片，光线总是不对。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/ghacb0xocsvbd4gjftq7ef5r608pya3.mp3","text":"我们可以去干掉坏人了吗？我就提个建议。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/q67vdg2tq4j0g6x0asorzvln6plxm7f.mp3","text":"切记——你拿枪只能对着坏人。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/l87nsygp9uvh8o14tyvlzvuh6zci3fd.mp3","text":"咱们都打起点精神来。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/5kry8nn7bg2910fzioali0zg6m5mmom.mp3","text":"坏人就在前方！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/85gglftkh4b81v8iv4vj01npkmrq9z6.mp3","text":"我还有时间去个卫生间么？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/mr0uatvtvmbjbir2tfck5e40gn3tblw.mp3","text":"谁想打喷嚏的现在快打。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/ekezffzi2tfzavbjavhib40vb8uylh1.mp3","text":"我们走！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/cd5z2s3m0ew8ao7bwkng8zsvpy3ix0e.mp3","text":"前进，快点！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/aor5fmk2bk1kuj9xoslwmgv3i0ytygj.mp3","text":"笑一个！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/rngtgvtl353cgnmsmja7p5ktdyy4sn1.mp3","text":"蹦！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/53uu7pqoisvatp80v6qwu4ib6sv9bej.mp3","text":"惊喜！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/5xmufaj1oqkw5efm7m5m7ubttxi6xs6.mp3","text":"喜欢吗！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/sw4rpcw0y5yyutpopojj4oyqbvz1dae.mp3","text":"没我事了？我能回家了吗？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/cie7j7gyuzz763ucdbwxfhb1plky29l.mp3","text":"一切都会顺利的，毕竟有我在。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/n222f539o2fgmah2qwam47lh3ebu8v5.mp3","text":"我是不是又要再救你们一次了？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/qxwq5zexwp0hat0jisfz4s3ziemu0er.mp3","text":"该死，就没人记得带弹药吗？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/glgxrl4lu04zatij2qxthfy8r5po059.mp3","text":"先和邻居打个招呼。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/rwjnykis0oidcwzywiuba06k1he1ul3.mp3","text":"喔！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/84wih1v3y7xm2j9m71apons7rh9e6qm.mp3","text":"快请我吃个饭，毕竟我们是朋友嘛。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/hwpcoc4q66v2c6nf1yn7xvtwzt36npy.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_037.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/25no3shhjtgxsiug6ngfq5038tcs3qb.mp3","text":"要出发了？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/461bbu9u3jh22iht2fthisu0vfnthi4.mp3","text":"我们应该一起去外面逛逛，在这里坐着干啥？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/7ln6xdgw8ot5uwfplmhvl74fo25kler.mp3","text":"下周的足球赛我可是首发，你一定要来看啊。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/fc0ug2kcseoiwlkinytq2ehgl620waj.mp3","text":"要是你们那儿有改进闪光护盾的好办法，尽管提测试申请，我随时就位。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/7kfsou4fshpu7qr7m8k3x2anudsbhtg.mp3","text":"放轻松，你太紧张了，需不需要我请战车来给你跳个芭蕾？","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/ntakw1sqg6uzdk98663n8f1nu4wmw4d.mp3","text":"医生们测试我不是因为病症，而是因为我足够强壮。还好我并不害怕针头。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/rhwbjbjfv7ecf5hg8edp44v1vekvikj.mp3","text":"闪一下，捶一下，砰！搞定！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/smnmfrhsiov7ddxsug7s4srhywmksu7.mp3","text":"是，我就是很欢乐，而且很幽默。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/p2ksnhpyc3eglbxyrufv78a86xc4b68.mp3","text":"要是有好事，记得带我一起玩。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/ienytzr55n7uml902mgr0ff9n2xqwmd.mp3","text":"我们大家有责任照顾好彼此，这件事情我绝对不开玩笑。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/huqx6p4h4yjkfmq56ze6hqbtfshd0fy.mp3","text":"这个挺有趣，但对我来说还缺点意思。","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/q8q4mt3ap0smhn2adarctdad8hbo4kn.mp3","text":"彩虹小队成员，代号闪击。你下令，我就把盾拍在目标脸上！","alt":"voice/char_457_blitz/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/lnj40p8l6o3cebait6ndgrcpg0rcpe3.mp3","text":"这个还挺不错，哦我是说爆米花，